    - **Shared-brain rules use a `host:harness:project` identity and can name either MCP tool surface.** `mempalace rules` takes `--host`, `--harness` and `--project` (stable lowercase tokens) instead of `--agent`, plus `--mcp full|light`: `full` (default) names the 45-tool `mempalace-mcp` tools, and `light` names the `palace_query` / `palace_exec` / `palace_coordinate` triad with identical prose. The rendered block has agents compose the identity from their current workspace, sweep the inbox when t... (truncated)
